<p><strong>Statement notes.</strong> All amounts are South African rand (ZAR). Receipt, wallet debit and completed-refund dates are system-recorded dates. A refund can relate to a payment outside the selected period. Pending or waived refunds are excluded.</p>
<p>Wallet funding and unused reservations are excluded. Hybrid checkouts show separate wallet and PayFast contributions. Checkout item fees are descriptive and are not added to payment totals. Category-change charges and wallet credits are included with entry fees.</p>
<p>Historical captured fees and current listed fees are reference information only, separate from verified receipts. No extra Cape Tennis fee is added to a listed fee. This statement is a payment history, not a tax invoice, wallet balance or amount-due notice. Unverified collections and payments awaiting reconciliation are excluded.</p>
